Retrospective for the slice: {{slice}}

## Evidence
Test results: {{test_results}}
Review findings: {{review_findings}}
Friction observed (where the implementer, reviewers or tools struggled): {{friction}}

## Task
Find the 1–3 changes that would most improve the next cycle. A change is only useful if it would have prevented a finding or friction above. For each:
- target: a prompt id (sdlc-slice-brief, sdlc-review-brief, sdlc-local-gate, sdlc-retro, phone-voice-assistant, android-proot-phone-ops), a skill reference file, or a code/test change
- the exact text to add or replace (quote it)
- which finding or friction it addresses
- how to tell next cycle whether it helped

Do not propose generic advice ("be more careful"). If nothing is worth changing, say so.
